  help put `@cases(...)` on a test that takes parameters
BYN1016 9:22 `i32 n, bool ok` is not allowed here
  label a test without `@cases` takes no parameters
  help add `@cases(...)` with one value per parameter for each case, or remove the parameters
BYN1016 14:1 `@cases` is not allowed here
  help combine the cases into one `@cases(...)`
